author=Cristimato
description=Vulkan 1.3 (blob r49p1) + vkshim v4.7: shaders bindless; erratas do compilador Mali; ClipDistance (recorte real), depthClamp, gl_DrawID no multiDrawIndirect e wireframe (geometry shader) emulados; correções das erratas do driver MK-16/MK-07/MK-11/MK-06; texturas BC1-BC7 (PixelBC); cache de pipelines. GLES continua r32p1. Props: debug.vkshim.clip/.clamp/.drawid/.nonsolid/.errata/.fake/.spv/.pcache/.bcn.
